// Refresh Token 轮换：旧 refresh 一旦被再次使用 -> 判定为泄露 -> 吊销整个 family
const store = new Map();   // refreshToken -> { userId, family, used }
let seq = 0;

function newToken(prefix) { seq += 1; return prefix + seq; }

function login(userId) {
  const family = 'fam-' + userId;
  const refresh = newToken('r');
  store.set(refresh, { userId, family, used: false });
  return { access: newToken('a'), refresh };
}
function refreshSession(refresh) {
  const rec = store.get(refresh);
  if (!rec) return { ok: false, reason: 'unknown-refresh' };
  if (rec.used) {
    // 复用检测：同一条 refresh 第二次出现 -> 很可能是被窃取，吊销该 family 所有 token
    for (const [k, v] of store) if (v.family === rec.family) v.used = true;
    return { ok: false, reason: 'reuse-detected-family-revoked' };
  }
  rec.used = true;
  const next = newToken('r');
  store.set(next, { userId: rec.userId, family: rec.family, used: false });
  return { ok: true, access: newToken('a'), refresh: next };
}

const s1 = login('u1');
console.log('issued_refresh=' + s1.refresh);
const step1 = refreshSession(s1.refresh);
console.log('normal_rotation_ok=' + step1.ok + ' new_refresh=' + step1.refresh);
const step2 = refreshSession(step1.refresh);
console.log('second_rotation_ok=' + step2.ok + ' new_refresh=' + step2.refresh);
// 攻击者拿着第一条 refresh 重放
const replay = refreshSession(s1.refresh);
console.log('old_refresh_replay_ok=' + replay.ok + ' reason=' + replay.reason);
// 连最新那条也被 family 吊销
const afterRevoke = refreshSession(step2.refresh);
console.log('family_revoked_latest_ok=' + afterRevoke.ok + ' reason=' + afterRevoke.reason);
console.log('rotation_shortens_refresh_lifetime=' + (step1.refresh !== s1.refresh));
